<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>ShopWise — Pricing</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #F8F7F4; --surface: #FFFFFF; --surface-2: #F2F0EB;
      --border: #E3E1DB; --border-2: #CCCAC3;
      --text-1: #0E0E0E; --text-2: #484540; --text-3: #8A877F;
      --radius: 8px; --radius-lg: 14px;
      --shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.07);
    }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text-1); line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    .container { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 40px; }

    /* Nav */
    nav { background: rgba(248,247,244,.93); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; backdrop-filter: blur(12px); }
    .nav-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 64px; }
    .nav-brand { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.03em; color: var(--text-1); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; }
    .nav-link  { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-2); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-link:hover { color: var(--text-1); }
    .nav-cta   { display: inline-flex; background: var(--text-1); color: #fff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-cta:hover { opacity: .88; }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 7px; border: none; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; transition: all .15s; padding: 13px 24px; }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--text-1); color: #fff; }
    .btn-primary:hover { opacity: .88; }
    .btn-outline { background: transparent; color: var(--text-1); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-2); }
    .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--text-1); }

    /* Label */
    .label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .8px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-3); }

    /* Page head */
    .page-head { padding: 88px 0 72px; text-align: center; }
    .page-head h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 56px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.04em; line-height: 1.08; margin: 16px 0 16px; }
    .page-head p  { font-size: 17px; color: var(--text-2); max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; }

    /* Pricing grid */
    .pricing-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; padding-bottom: 96px; }
    .price-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 30px; position: relative; }
    .price-card.featured { border-color: var(--text-1); }
    .featured-tag { position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 24px; background: var(--text-1); color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .2px; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 4px; }
    .plan-name { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-1); margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .plan-desc { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.65; }
    .plan-price { margin: 22px 0; padding: 18px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .price-amt  { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-1); line-height: 1; }
    .price-per  { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-3); margin-top: 5px; }
    .plan-features { list-style: none; }
    .plan-features li { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-2); padding: 9px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 10px; }
    .plan-features li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .plan-features li::before { content: '—'; color: var(--text-3); flex-shrink: 0; }
    .plan-features li.dim { color: var(--text-3); }
    .plan-cta { margin-top: 24px; width: 100%; justify-content: center; }

    /* FAQ */
    .faq { padding: 72px 0 96px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .faq h2 { font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.03em; margin: 14px 0 36px; }
    .faq-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .faq-item h3 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-1); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .faq-item p  { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.7; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .container { padding: 0 20px; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .pricing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .faq-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .page-head { padding: 64px 0 52px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="container nav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="nav-brand">ShopWise</a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/sample/overview" class="nav-link">Sample report</a>
      <a href="/" class="nav-link">Home</a>
      <a href="/#analyze" class="nav-cta">Run a Reality Check</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="container">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="label">Pricing</div>
    <h1>Simple and transparent</h1>
    <p>Start with a free scan to understand your situation. Pay only when you want the full diagnosis.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="pricing-grid">

    <div class="price-card">
      <div class="plan-name">Free Scan</div>
      <div class="plan-desc">A high-level diagnosis: your market pressure rating, fixability score, and top 3 prioritised actions.</div>
      <div class="plan-price">
        <div class="price-amt">$0</div>
        <div class="price-per">No account required</div>
      </div>
      <ul class="plan-features">
        <li>Market Pressure rating (High / Medium / Low)</li>
        <li>Fixability Score (0–100%)</li>
        <li>3 prioritised actions</li>
        <li>Nearby competitor count</li>
        <li class="dim">Full factor breakdown</li>
        <li class="dim">Competitor benchmarks</li>
        <li class="dim">Strategy recommendation</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/#analyze" class="btn btn-outline plan-cta">Run Free Scan</a>
    </div>

    <div class="price-card featured">
      <div class="featured-tag">Full analysis</div>
      <div class="plan-name">Diagnosis Report</div>
      <div class="plan-desc">The complete Reality Check — every factor scored, benchmarked against nearby competitors, and explained in plain language.</div>
      <div class="plan-price">
        <div class="price-amt">$29</div>
        <div class="price-per">One-time · no subscription</div>
      </div>
      <ul class="plan-features">
        <li>Everything in Free Scan</li>
        <li>Full controllable factor breakdown</li>
        <li>External pressure analysis</li>
        <li>Competitor benchmark (10+ nearby)</li>
        <li>Strategy recommendation</li>
        <li>PDF export</li>
        <li class="dim">Monthly tracking</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/#analyze" class="btn btn-primary plan-cta">Get Full Report</a>
    </div>

    <div class="price-card">
      <div class="plan-name">Monthly Monitoring</div>
      <div class="plan-desc">Track how your scores change month by month as you implement improvements and market conditions shift.</div>
      <div class="plan-price">
        <div class="price-amt">$49</div>
        <div class="price-per">Per month · cancel anytime</div>
      </div>
      <ul class="plan-features">
        <li>Everything in Diagnosis Report</li>
        <li>Fresh report each month</li>
        <li>Score change tracking</li>
        <li>New competitor alerts</li>
        <li>Market condition updates</li>
        <li>Unlimited PDF exports</li>
        <li>Priority support</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/#analyze" class="btn btn-outline plan-cta">Start Monitoring</a>
    </div>

  </section>

  <section class="faq">
    <div class="label">Common questions</div>
    <h2>What you should know</h2>
    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How accurate is the diagnosis?</h3>
        <p>The report is based on public data signals, your inputs, and algorithmic benchmarking. It is a structured starting point, not a definitive audit. It is most accurate when you provide your Google rating, review count, and area.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What does "Fixability Score" mean exactly?</h3>
        <p>It estimates the proportion of your business challenges that appear addressable through your own actions — as opposed to structural market conditions. A score of 60% means roughly 60% of the identified issues are in your hands.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Is this just marketing advice?</h3>
        <p>No. ShopWise explicitly separates marketing and operational factors from external structural pressures like competition density, local demand, and cost environment. The goal is an honest picture, not a sales pitch for more marketing spend.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Do I need an account?</h3>
        <p>Not for the free scan. The full Diagnosis Report and Monthly Monitoring plans require a basic account to store and track your results over time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

</body>
</html>
